| Dimension | IaaS | PaaS | SaaS |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Control Level** | Maximum control over OS & stack | Control over code & data only | Control over user settings only |
| **Maintenance Burden** | High (patch OS, configure networking) | Low (no OS or server maintenance) | Zero (provider handles all updates) |
| **Primary Audience** | System Administrators, Cloud Architects | Software Developers | End Users, Everyday Employees |
| **Analogy** | Rental Car | Taxi / Ride-share | Public Bus |
